# Status: connection, version, slots from werkbuch, the load with its history, the running run and the recent ones.
Output ".vhs/status.gif"
Source "docs/tapes/config.tape"

Hide
Type "werkbuch-runner" Enter
Sleep 3s
Show
Sleep 300ms
Screenshot "docs/screenshots/status.png"
Sleep 300ms # VHS takes the screenshot on a later frame; do not end the tape before it
